<title>USA: Capstone buys Pennsylvania Prescriptions.</title>
<headline>Capstone buys Pennsylvania Prescriptions.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, TEXAS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capstone Pharmacy Services Inc said Friday it has acquired the assets of Pennsylvania Prescriptions Inc  which does business as Emerald Drug Store. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Capstone is an independent institutional pharmacy company serving over 120,000 beds in long term facilities.</p>
<p>Pennsylvania Prescriptions, based in Harrisburg, does business as Emerald Drug Stores.</p>
